    "email": {
      "subject": "FNOL Notice \u2014 Coastal Property Management LLC / Policy CPP-2214569",
      "body": "Good morning,\n\nPlease accept this email as first notice of loss for Coastal Property Management LLC under policy CPP-2214569 issued by Nationwide Mutual Insurance Company.\n\nReported loss details:\n\u2022 Date of loss: 01/28/2026\n\u2022 Type of loss: Water damage from a tenant-suite plumbing leak\n\u2022 Location: Westshore Plaza retail center, 500 N Westshore Blvd, Tampa, FL 33609\n\u2022 Areas affected: Common-area corridor and adjacent storage room\n\u2022 Immediate action taken: Water was shut off, area was mitigated, and a restoration vendor was engaged\n\nPlease acknowledge receipt and advise the claim number, assigned adjuster, and any next steps. If you need photographs, invoices, or additional statements, Hector Ramos is available at (813) 555-0177 or hramos@coastalpm.com.\n\nThank you,\n\nGulf Coast Insurance Group\n\nSent from my iPhone",
      "sender": "Megan Lawson's Assistant <assistant@nationwide.com> on behalf of Megan Lawson <submissions@gulfcoastig.com>",
      "recipient": "claims@nationwide.com, underwriting@nationwide.com"
    },
